# This file is shared by EVERY Vercel project connected to this repo — Vercel
# applies the repo-root .vercelignore to a project's clone even when that
# project's Root Directory is a subfolder (there is no card-engine/.vercelignore
# to override it). A line here that assumes "the Wiki only" is scoped wrong and
# will strip files another project's build needs.
#
# Case in point: this file used to exclude card-engine/public/assets/castle/
# occluders/ on the theory that only the Wiki reads it for size. The game's own
# TypeScript imports occluders.json and colliders.json as modules at compile
# time, so that line broke the game's production build for four deploys in a
# row while looking like a Wiki-only change. See PRODUCTION.md decision log,
# 2026-08-04.
#
# The Studio Wiki no longer needs help here at all: its own build controls
# what it ships via studio-wiki/asset-manifest.ts, which trims the OUTPUT to
# what it displays regardless of what exists in the source clone. So this file
# only lists things that are safe to exclude from every project, always.

# Local dependency/build trees are recreated by every project and must never upload.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local-only deployment and scratch state.
.vercel/
.env*
ai-snapshot-output/
scratchpad/

# Non-web production sources — reference material, not a deploy input for
# any project.
Card Images/
Classes and Boss Battles/
Combat_Fullscreen_Correction_Handoff/
docs/archive/
